# The guest binary the archived hardware logs were produced with.
# A diff is only meaningful between logs from the same ELF.
5a3d3937a47cda0606882e62e5019901  cputest.elf

# The tree has since moved by exactly one change: cp0/count_writable now
# retries instead of sampling Count once (it was the suite's only
# run-to-run-variable check, and it broke the CI baseline). That test passes on
# the first attempt on real silicon, where Count is clocked at half the
# pipeline rate, so the change cannot alter any result in these logs — but the
# hash differs, and pretending otherwise would defeat the point of recording it.
